{"_id": "bINs2lGxZhOsFW8F", "name": "Drive (d8)", "img": "icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-worn-tan.webp", "description": "Why they're doing any of this (Ch. 2).", "formula": "1d8", "replacement": true, "displayRoll": true, "results": [{"_id": "MwZaqt8SwsqDXqeD", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Debt</b> \u2014 you owe something to someone, or something, that can't be repaid in coin.", "weight": 1, "range": [1, 1], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "IDNkglZSFgxPEyxJ", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Vengeance</b> \u2014 someone specific has to answer for something specific.", "weight": 1, "range": [2, 2], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "0lDUQ0YW9WxTH1Fv", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Atonement</b> \u2014 you did a thing you cannot undo, and you're trying to be someone else now.", "weight": 1, "range": [3, 3], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "eONO31sC79hDWHfG", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Legacy</b> \u2014 you're building or protecting something meant to outlast you.", "weight": 1, "range": [4, 4], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "jplwzMmNqqY7kxNd", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Hunger</b> \u2014 you want more than you have, and you've stopped pretending otherwise.", "weight": 1, "range": [5, 5], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "e2VEBQnmNGbITrBD", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Belonging</b> \u2014 you're looking for a place, or people, that will actually keep you.", "weight": 1, "range": [6, 6], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "e71pXP3gGAwiqIRj", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Curiosity</b> \u2014 some question matters more to you than your own safety.", "weight": 1, "range": [7, 7], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "wHqZmSVAgLUAFLrl", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Freedom</b> \u2014 someone or something owns a piece of you, and you intend to take it back.", "weight": 1, "range": [8, 8], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}], "flags": {}}
{"_id": "cScNALFO6IfGUj5Q", "name": "Trauma (d8)", "img": "icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-worn-tan.webp", "description": "A scar that still bites: a Trigger and a Flinch (Ch. 2).", "formula": "1d8", "replacement": true, "displayRoll": true, "results": [{"_id": "ThZo6TMekwrNhgiR", "type": 0, "text": "<b>The Cold Room</b> \u2014 Trigger: Confinement, being trapped Flinch: \u221220 to all Reckonings until you act to escape or fight free.", "weight": 1, "range": [1, 1], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "NPIgJ9u0XD13HBJ2", "type": 0, "text": "<b>The Silence After</b> \u2014 Trigger: Sudden violence against someone helpless Flinch: Willpower Reckoning or freeze for one exchange.", "weight": 1, "range": [2, 2], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "CSFSUFWqFJUEDq18", "type": 0, "text": "<b>The Debt of Breath</b> \u2014 Trigger: Someone dies because of a choice you made Flinch: \u221220 to Reckonings touching that person's name, image, or memory, for the rest of the scene.", "weight": 1, "range": [3, 3], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "CUy5tLnoL1NWXv8B", "type": 0, "text": "<b>The Watching Dark</b> \u2014 Trigger: Magic used nearby, or its aftermath Flinch: \u221210 to all Reckonings until real distance is put between you and the working.", "weight": 1, "range": [4, 4], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "2dHfpfXrGrgbisZQ", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Never Enough</b> \u2014 Trigger: Offered charity or unearned help Flinch: Willpower Reckoning to accept it gracefully.", "weight": 1, "range": [5, 5], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "fd0Rzv0NVarWXz0I", "type": 0, "text": "<b>The Last Order</b> \u2014 Trigger: Given a direct command by an authority figure Flinch: Willpower Reckoning to refuse it, even when refusal is clearly right.", "weight": 1, "range": [6, 6], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "RjE8L5rQAPNsQWfm", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Salt and Ash</b> \u2014 Trigger: Fire, or the smell of a structure burning Flinch: \u221220 to all Reckonings for the rest of the scene.", "weight": 1, "range": [7, 7], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "PyFvqyp1WVT1Kq2p", "type": 0, "text": "<b>The Unanswered Question</b> \u2014 Trigger: A direct lie, told to your face, by someone you trusted Flinch: You believe it once, automatically \u2014 no Reckoning permitted.", "weight": 1, "range": [8, 8], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}], "flags": {}}
{"_id": "2JHhy2zgAGj4L60Y", "name": "Marks of the Seam \u2014 Brands (d10)", "img": "icons/magic/unholy/silhouette-robe-evil-power.webp", "description": "Roll or choose when Ash reaches the Threshold (Ch. 4).", "formula": "1d10", "replacement": true, "displayRoll": true, "results": [{"_id": "472Bwvr3i3dQaHWq", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Ash-Veined</b> \u2014 Grey webbing under the skin. \u22125 to Presence-based Reckonings with strangers; +5 Intimidation.", "weight": 1, "range": [1, 1], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "zWwdRrUd0VZDRAGH", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Beast-Eyes</b> \u2014 See in darkness as dim light. Animals refuse you: \u221210 Riding and handling.", "weight": 1, "range": [2, 2], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "RVDl1gX8mgFS5B9t", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Numb Flesh</b> \u2014 Ignore the \u22125 from one Wound at a time \u2014 but you don't feel Bleeding; the GM tracks it in secret.", "weight": 1, "range": [3, 3], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "4BDA7rw2i3QPxHc8", "type": 0, "text": "<b>The Wrong Shadow</b> \u2014 Your shadow lags and looks elsewhere. \u221210 Stealth in any light; once per day it warns you: +10 against one ambush.", "weight": 1, "range": [4, 4], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "0k31sHOAeNmXbLG3", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Cold Hearth</b> \u2014 Fires gutter near you. Fire damage against you \u22121; everything you cook tastes of ash (\u221210 Cooking).", "weight": 1, "range": [5, 5], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "xLqF8J4Brs6u6kgS", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Whisper-Ear</b> \u2014 Once per session, ask the GM one yes/no question; the Seam answers truthfully. Each use: +1 Ash.", "weight": 1, "range": [6, 6], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "m5JbQqssTktygtfD", "type": 0, "text": "<b>The Other Hunger</b> \u2014 You must consume something unspeakable daily \u2014 grave-soil, tallow, raw liver \u2014 or take a Hungry Condition no food removes.", "weight": 1, "range": [7, 7], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "FGUC0EQeCPhrNyxs", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Leaking Dreams</b> \u2014 Sleepers near you share your nightmares: the whole camp takes \u22125 to recovery unless you sleep apart.", "weight": 1, "range": [8, 8], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "tzi0WRwFnEzIzznE", "type": 0, "text": "<b>Stitched Voice</b> \u2014 Two voices speak when you do. \u221210 Deception; +5 Ritual Casting.", "weight": 1, "range": [9, 9], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "eUFBx7nDRMN0En1r", "type": 0, "text": "<b>The Burning Sigil</b> \u2014 A scar-glyph. Your Rites cost 1 less Resolve \u2014 and anyone trained to see it senses you within Near range.", "weight": 1, "range": [10, 10], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}], "flags": {}}
{"_id": "2Dk7VussPaqYIEh8", "name": "Foraging & Encounters \u2014 Forest (d12)", "img": "icons/environment/wilderness/tree-oak.webp", "description": "Roll when the party travels, camps, or forages (Ch. 7 / Field Guide B.7).", "formula": "1d12", "replacement": true, "displayRoll": true, "results": [{"_id": "SeSCKAXGlTCdZaKW", "type": 0, "text": "red deer", "weight": 1, "range": [1, 1], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "cB2Awgfihit8wiem", "type": 0, "text": "boar", "weight": 1, "range": [2, 2], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "etTZP6KVQmC8MUbJ", "type": 0, "text": "grey wolves", "weight": 1, "range": [3, 3], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "PxmuzRo3VfQpEAfN", "type": 0, "text": "fox", "weight": 1, "range": [4, 4], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "ThCLn5EL5YovwXyu", "type": 0, "text": "hare", "weight": 1, "range": [5, 5], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "Ga7FqJFT3U1s2UW4", "type": 0, "text": "kingsfoil patch", "weight": 1, "range": [6, 6], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "pJqMcpmCXs8fGL8G", "type": 0, "text": "boar (cornered)", "weight": 1, "range": [7, 7], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "gS9UeQjJxEcpnF1L", "type": 0, "text": "woodcutters", "weight": 1, "range": [8, 8], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "tRg3p17uoplAyyIC", "type": 0, "text": "bandits (B.7 group)", "weight": 1, "range": [9, 9], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "hYd3KWWe2pRRqrqo", "type": 0, "text": "ironoak grove", "weight": 1, "range": [10, 10], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "Dfw0sekml2yKj1j4", "type": 0, "text": "deep-forest folk", "weight": 1, "range": [11, 11], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "s2PhHEHDqQ0ZqQKQ", "type": 0, "text": "the wrong quiet (Seam)", "weight": 1, "range": [12, 12], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}], "flags": {}}
{"_id": "66pSUaG6qsCka8ph", "name": "Foraging & Encounters \u2014 Marsh (d12)", "img": "icons/environment/wilderness/tree-oak.webp", "description": "Roll when the party travels, camps, or forages (Ch. 7 / Field Guide B.7).", "formula": "1d12", "replacement": true, "displayRoll": true, "results": [{"_id": "fCgd51123I5Z7VW9", "type": 0, "text": "eel", "weight": 1, "range": [1, 1], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "RTTsJweLVVqkRV6P", "type": 0, "text": "heron", "weight": 1, "range": [2, 2], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "mnf1NVyoKG3vFw12", "type": 0, "text": "constrictor", "weight": 1, "range": [3, 3], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "yE8JVHINuTpkOqr7", "type": 0, "text": "marsh leech", "weight": 1, "range": [4, 4], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "Zy8oyl0MRwlKlKxi", "type": 0, "text": "wildfowl", "weight": 1, "range": [5, 5], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "KCUmPYWrFkRBKEhA", "type": 0, "text": "willowbark", "weight": 1, "range": [6, 6], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "B3AoAiTEdaGDS8Gt", "type": 0, "text": "bog-drowned!", "weight": 1, "range": [7, 7], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "VUt18RWM7UWV9z5A", "type": 0, "text": "fisher-folk", "weight": 1, "range": [8, 8], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "FofJoCFxmwSaigV5", "type": 0, "text": "smugglers", "weight": 1, "range": [9, 9], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "bwkx5ut5UWy1oPUK", "type": 0, "text": "Thin-Place echo!", "weight": 1, "range": [10, 10], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "2yMUbJAVUwNJUMaq", "type": 0, "text": "fever-air (disease)", "weight": 1, "range": [11, 11], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "BmZ25lg1twSFaf6H", "type": 0, "text": "the Weeping Saint's reach", "weight": 1, "range": [12, 12], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}], "flags": {}}
{"_id": "B9DmX0vf5tmq0GVX", "name": "Foraging & Encounters \u2014 Hill / Moor (d12)", "img": "icons/environment/wilderness/tree-oak.webp", "description": "Roll when the party travels, camps, or forages (Ch. 7 / Field Guide B.7).", "formula": "1d12", "replacement": true, "displayRoll": true, "results": [{"_id": "TC2x1zZK8ui4dyCb", "type": 0, "text": "mountain goat", "weight": 1, "range": [1, 1], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "QwWsZCMnLIFerFmX", "type": 0, "text": "wild sheep", "weight": 1, "range": [2, 2], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "xruo8TUllq4KD4pC", "type": 0, "text": "golden eagle", "weight": 1, "range": [3, 3], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "rEHTrFmHbH52mFsO", "type": 0, "text": "lynx", "weight": 1, "range": [4, 4], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "hA8OSRV8p4Jn4Tar", "type": 0, "text": "hare", "weight": 1, "range": [5, 5], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "5oa4t3HqDuVe1Tiu", "type": 0, "text": "emberleaf", "weight": 1, "range": [6, 6], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "17l0u680eaqOAkNU", "type": 0, "text": "bear", "weight": 1, "range": [7, 7], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "ybF0hBgxJZ335Ftg", "type": 0, "text": "shepherds", "weight": 1, "range": [8, 8], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "hlnRbuJzcZI2w4kP", "type": 0, "text": "raiders", "weight": 1, "range": [9, 9], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "FsD9Bb3y7vsxmWz7", "type": 0, "text": "barrow (wight?)", "weight": 1, "range": [10, 10], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "6E8XRKpDZ9QRcSjZ", "type": 0, "text": "standing stones", "weight": 1, "range": [11, 11], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "LBW9S6DVkpwaGJSm", "type": 0, "text": "ash on the wind", "weight": 1, "range": [12, 12], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}], "flags": {}}
{"_id": "vNNNF91h3CLcTXlw", "name": "Foraging & Encounters \u2014 Coast (d12)", "img": "icons/environment/wilderness/tree-oak.webp", "description": "Roll when the party travels, camps, or forages (Ch. 7 / Field Guide B.7).", "formula": "1d12", "replacement": true, "displayRoll": true, "results": [{"_id": "9cN4csPwcrj3Qo6K", "type": 0, "text": "cod shoal", "weight": 1, "range": [1, 1], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "OBkkPMTAIq7PtPAv", "type": 0, "text": "seal", "weight": 1, "range": [2, 2], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "4OK7P5KmdicoKcHI", "type": 0, "text": "gulls (eggs)", "weight": 1, "range": [3, 3], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "BJOZAsU8DgBNaAwE", "type": 0, "text": "crab", "weight": 1, "range": [4, 4], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "CQofWkvPWWpVli9v", "type": 0, "text": "driftwood & salvage", "weight": 1, "range": [5, 5], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "MHKaIjdKycCaSjJV", "type": 0, "text": "ambergris (rare)", "weight": 1, "range": [6, 6], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "c70ZMSvVeHWsDWbh", "type": 0, "text": "storm coming (Ch. 8)", "weight": 1, "range": [7, 7], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "bHssrPxaspXpSU2f", "type": 0, "text": "fishing boat", "weight": 1, "range": [8, 8], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "Nesy3UY4g1H1IsBk", "type": 0, "text": "pirates (offshore)", "weight": 1, "range": [9, 9], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "JDIx0D56VpoVLCXS", "type": 0, "text": "wreck (loot + risk)", "weight": 1, "range": [10, 10], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "cymPVPIcdBrYFASY", "type": 0, "text": "salt-pans (Combine)", "weight": 1, "range": [11, 11], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}, {"_id": "bPzoFITbw6OLcuZZ", "type": 0, "text": "a ship, becalmed & silent", "weight": 1, "range": [12, 12], "drawn": false, "img": "icons/svg/d20-black.svg", "flags": {}}], "flags": {}}
